1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Gabriel Smith''' (1853-1934) havnedirektør, Slemdal i Aker
2 CONT
2 CONT Gift med: Henny Lucie Roggen
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Barn===
2 CONT
2 CONT # [http://www.geni.com/people/Christen-Smith/6000000019546405145 Christen Smith] 	- 30 Jan 1882 - Vardø
2 CONT # [http://www.geni.com/people/Danchert-Smith/6000000019546540034 Danchert Roggen Smith] - 7 Jul 1884 - Ålesund
2 CONT # [http://www.geni.com/people/Gudrun-Smith/6000000019545828545 Gudrun Smith] - 28 Apr 1886 - Ålesund
2 CONT # Ingrid Smith - 10.01.1889 - Aalesund
