1 NAME Anders /Andersen Dedekam/
2 GIVN Anders
2 SURN Andersen Dedekam
2 _MARNM Andersen
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1669
2 ADDR
3 CITY Arendal
3 STAE Aust-Agder
