1 NAME Mikkel Trulsen /Kjos/
2 GIVN Mikkel Trulsen
2 SURN Kjos
1 SEX M
1 BURI
2 PLAC Ullensaker, Akershus, Norge
2 ADDR
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1720
2 ADDR
