2 CONT
2 CONT Eivind Skabo    vant kongepokalen i padling, 1946.1949. ____________________________________________
2 CONT
2 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT Olympic Games: Bronze medal – third place 1948 London K-1 10000 m 
2 CONT
2 CONT World Championships Silver medal – second place 1948 London K-1 4 x 500 m 
2 CONT
2 CONT Eivind Skabo (August 17, 1916 – April 18, 2006) was a Norwegian sprint canoer who competed in the late 1940s. He won a bronze medal in the K-1 10000 m event at the 1948 Summer Olympics in London.
2 CONT
2 CONT Skabio also won a silver medal in K-1 4 x 500 m at the 1948 ICF Canoe Sprint World Championships, also in London.
