1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Fra svigerfaren Bang gikk ringene videre til Hans Tysch Dedekam (1707-1791), som fikk havnekommisjonens skjøte i august 1750. Fortøyningsringene hadde stor verdi for eierne. Tysch Dedekam pantsatte 17 havneringer p
2 CONC å Merdø, Revesand, Sandvigen og Torjusholmen den 6. oktober 1764 til Arendals Hospital, for hele 1000 riksdaler. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ==English Translation ==
2 CONT
2 CONT From in-law Bang went the rings on to his Tysch Dedekam (1707-1791), who was ending Commission deed in August 1750. The mooring rings had great value for the owners.Tysch Dedekam pledged 17 ports projections on Merdø, REVESAND, Sa
2 CONC ndvigen and Torjus Holmen on October 6, 1764 Arendal Hospital, for 1000 thalers.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.etranslator.ro/norwegian-english-online-translator.php
